  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infocom support 2013 in Sweden to Grren Forum, party affiliated to    the Green Party. The aim of the project is to increase the general    public&apos;s knowledge and understanding for the green party political    movement, with a focus on the development in developing countries as  well as increasing the knowledge and understanding of party creation  in a development context.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Infokom-st&#xf6;d 2013 i Sverige till Green Forum, partianknuten till      Milj&#xf6;partiet. Projektet vill &#xf6;ka den svenska allm&#xe4;nhetens kunskap och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r den gr&#xf6;na partipolitiska globala r&#xf6;relsen, med fokus   p&#xe5; utvecklingen i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder samt &#xf6;ka den svenska allm&#xe4;nhetens kunskap- och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r partibildning i en utvecklingskontext.</narrative>
  </description>
